## 5) Fix Template Links (Important!)

When converting HTML template into Blade:

✅ Change:

```html
<link href="css/style.css">
<script src="js/app.js"></script>
<img src="img/logo.png">
```

✅ To:

```blade
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/css/style.css') }}">
<script src="{{ asset('assets/js/app.js') }}"></script>
<img src="{{ asset('assets/img/logo.png') }}">
```

---

## 6) Add Page-Specific CSS/JS (Optional)

In any page:

```blade
@push('styles')
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/css/special-page.css') }}">
@endpush

@push('scripts')
  <script src="{{ asset('assets/js/special-page.js') }}"></script>
@endpush
```

